{'symbol': 'OKE', 'date': '2019-10-28 22:30:00', 'title': 'ONEOK, INC. ANNOUNCES EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE QUARTER AND NINE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019; UPDATES EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FULL YEAR 2019', 'text': "ONEOK, INC. ANNOUNCED EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE QUARTER AND NINE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019. FOR THE QUARTER, THE COMPANY'S REPORTED NET INCOME WAS $309.2 MILLION COMPARED TO $313.9 MILLION FOR THE SAME PERIOD A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS $482.2 MILLION COMPARED TO $495.5 MILLION FOR THE SAME PERIOD A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME PER DILUTED SHARE WAS $0.74 COMPARED TO $0.75 FOR THE SAME PERIOD A YEAR AGO. FOR THE NINE MONTHS, THE COMPANY'S REPORTED NET INCOME WAS $958.3 MILLION COMPARED TO $862.1 MILLION FOR THE SAME PERIOD A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS $1,427.0 MILLION COMPARED TO $1,363.6 MILLION FOR THE SAME PERIOD A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME PER DILUTED SHARE WAS $2.31 COMPARED TO $2.07 FOR THE SAME PERIOD A YEAR AGO. FOR THE YEAR 2019, THE COMPANY NET INCOME IS EXPECTED TO BE IN THE RANGE OF $1,220 MILLION TO $1,330 MILLION, COMPARED WITH PREVIOUS RANGE OF $1,140 MILLION TO $1,400 MILLION."}